window.products.push({"id":546076,"name":"Dawn 5-Piece Bed-in-a-Bag Comforter Set in Floral Gray | Twin/Twin XL Size | Reversible Comforter and Sham(s) with Matching Sheet & Pillowcase Set | S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712DfEoeuQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% Microfiber Made in the USA or Imported TOTAL BEDDING SET: An irresistible bedroom awaits. Dawn's bedding set has everything you need to transform your space into an oasis of total relaxation and comfort, from a reversible comforter that lets you choose a print or solid to the soft microfiber sheets. You'll love the instant style and the affordable price of this bed-in-a-bag set. Set includes comforter, sham(s), flat sheet, fitted sheet and pillow case(s). FLORAL GRAY: Pretty and light, our Floral Gray brings a sweet daisy print pattern in gray on white to your room. Reversible to a solid deep gray, you get two great looks in one. The coordinating solid microfiber sheet set in medium gray keeps you surrounded in softness all night long. COZY STYLE FOR LESS: This set is definitely the start of something beautiful. Comforter and pillow sham(s) let you design the bedroom of your dreams for less. And with matching sheets, it's so easy. 5-PIECE SET INCLUDES: 1 Twin/Twin XL Comforter: 66\" x 90\", 1 Standard Pillow Sham: 20\" x 26\", 1 Twin/Twin XL Fitted Sheet: 39\" x 80\" with 12\" Pocket; 1 Twin/Twin XL Flat Sheet: 66\" x 100\" and 1 Standard Pillowcase: 20\" x 30\" EASY TO LOVE: 100% Microfiber surrounds you in velvety softness that holds up wash after wash. Oh and did we mention, all pieces are machine washable? It's that easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712DfEoeuQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dawn","source_asin":"B099DDBC4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099DDBC4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099DDBC4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
