window.products.push({"id":546279,"name":"Air Fryer 6.2 QT Oilless AirFryer 1500W Electric Healthy Oven Cooker Large Capacity with Visible Cooking Window, 10 Presets in One Touch , Digital Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g1cfm1TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional Air Fryer: With a 6.2 QT capacity and 1500W power, this air fryer equipped with a high-definition touch screen, built-in cooking light, and double-wall insulated viewing windows are designed to be the perfect assistant for your cooking and decoration of your kitchen counter. It can replace a variety of kitchen appliances such as a toaster, rotisserie, fruit dryer, oven, etc., perfect for families who pursue a healthy diet. One-Touch Operation: With 10 preset cooking programs and an easy-to-use LED touch screen, this air fryer oven can quickly cook according to your needs in one click, such as french fries, roast chicken, roast pizza, fruit drier, or reheat leftovers and so on. Also, you can adjust the temperature (up to 400°F) and time (up to 60mins) to cook according to your personal preference. The Choice for Healthy: Our air fryer oven with 360° hot air circulation with 6.2 QT capacity and 1500W power. It can fit a 4-6lbs chicken, 4-8in pizza, 6-10 chicken wings, 2 steaks, or 400-600g french fries. Make your food crispy and tender with little to no oil. You can enjoy your favorite meals without worrying about the additional calories and fats. EASY & LARGE: The square basket design of the 6.2 QT air fryer is sufficient for a larger cooking capacity than round ones, which can serve 2~5 people in just one go! The basket is made of nonstick material. A removable non-stick rack keeps food raised off the bottom and allows air circulation, making food more crispy and low-fat. The Best Gift: The 6.2 qt family-size large air fryer saves space on your counter and in your cabinet. It is a must-have for an apartment, smaller kitchen, college dorm life, or camper/RV traveling. It is the perfect gift for family or friends. Please always feel free to contact us if you have any questions during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g1cfm1TaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"deime","source_asin":"B0BM63CR91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM63CR91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM63CR91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
