window.products.push({"id":546284,"name":"Blender Replacement Parts for Nutri Ninja, 16 oz Single Serve Blender Cups with Lids and 6 Fins Blade Assembly Compatible with Ninja Professional Blen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OEWVDktUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBLE MODEL: Fit for Ninja Professional Blender Ninja BL660 30 (1100w), BL770 (1500w), Ninja BL740, BL663, BL663CO 30, BL665Q, BL770W, BL771, BL771C, BL772, BL772Q, BL773, BL773CO, BL780, BL770 30, BL773CO 30, BL771 30, BL780 30, BL780CO 30. Replacement 16oz cups have”FOUR TABS”, please make sure the original cups also have 4 tabs before replacing. Blade Size: 3.35\"/ 8.5cm diameter. 16 oz Single Serve Cups Size: 6.88\"/ 17.5cm cup height; 3.15\"/ 8cm diameter; 2.56\"/ 6.5cm bottom diameter. SAFE & PREMIUM MATERIAL: The replacement Blade and Cup set is made of food-grade Plastic and Upgraded strength stainless steel without leak and rusty, safe and Durable. Every blade and cup has undergone strict testing before leaving the factory. Replace them and continue to blend your way to a healthier lifestyle of nutritious shakes, smoothies, nut butter. We’d like to address any issues or concerns you have so please do not hesitate to contact us. EASY TO USE: No need to buy the cup and blade separately for assembly, directly choose this set for replacement without worrying about whether the blade and cup are compatible. Replacement the Accessories when Nutri Ninja blender is leaking or getting noisier, we are recommended to check the bottom blade regularly and replace it every 6 months for good performance. REPLACEMENT PARTS INCLUDE: 1x Replacement Blade Assembly (One Gasket pre-installed already ); 1x 16 oz single serve Replacement cup; 1x Sip Lid; 1x Brush. One set to meet the needs. USAGE TIP: Blend personalized smoothies and juices in the 16oz cups ( Our 6fin blade only can fit for 16oz cup). Crush through ice and frozen ingredients pls use in 72oz cups. Please classify correctly and use the cup for mixing, otherwise, it may damage the parts. Check the gear of the bottom before use, If it's loose, please tighten it. We don't claim these are original Nutri Ninja. It is only used to prove the compatibility of accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OEWVDktUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feilifan","source_asin":"B09WMGKP46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMGKP46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMGKP46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
