window.products.push({"id":546302,"name":"Cake Cutting Set for Wedding, EIUBUIE Cake Knife and Server Set, Classic Design 18/10 Stainless Steel Pie Cake Serving Set of 2 Piece, Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jJn+7D8IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【Exceptional Gift Idea】2 Pieces Cake Serving Set Including 1 Piece Pie Pastry Cake Knife with a stainless steel curved blade and 1 Piece Cake Pastry Pie Server. The wedding cake cutting set come packaged in a nice, gift-ready Box, Makes for a great Wedding Gift or Christmas gifts and keepsake items to remember your special day forever! ✨【Dainty but Durable】Some cake server sets look high-end but are disappointingly flimsy. Our cake knife and server set are made of a one-piece 18/10 finest stainless steel which is strong and durable enough to withstand decades of use. The one-piece structure, not easy to hide dirt and easy to clean, Dishwasher safe, You can just put them in a dishwasher for saving time in handwashing, we suggest also drying it after washing as soon as possible. ✨【Timeless Sleek Cake Knife and Server Set】EIUBUIE wedding cake cutter and server set have a sleek and simple design that will remain on trend. The wedding knife set features slim lines, subtle curves, substantial weight and attractive lustrous, mirror-like finish. The high-polished mirror pie servers made of food-grade 304 stainless steel would lead to lifetime use without fading, always Bright and bright after use. ✨【Cake Knife for Smooth Cutting】Cut through layers of cake effortlessly with our wedding cake knife. Featuring a sharp blade, a long reach, and an ergonomic handle, it does a neat job of slicing any cake or pie. This cake server set for wedding knife is 11.2” long. Server is 9.09” long. Timeless elegant design makes this cake cutting set appropriate for formal events, parties, weddings, anniversaries, birthday or everyday meals. ✨【Personalized Wedding Knife and Cake Server Set】If you want to make it into something different or more personal, you could also DIY it with jute, brooches, twine etc. so that the wedding serving set will better match with any wedding party theme well. We wish to satisfy your purchase. If you are not, please contact us by sending a message, we will provide you with a solution that satisfies you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jJn+7D8IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EIUBUIE","source_asin":"B0BVQZ8T3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVQZ8T3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVQZ8T3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
