window.products.push({"id":546311,"name":"TORRAS COOLIFY 2S Neck Air Conditioner, Cool Down 30°F in 1S Neck Fan, Strong Wind Portable Neck Fan, Neck Cooler and Heater Personal Neck Fan 3-Speed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rkkgPOpEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Cool Down by 30°F in 1 Second] COOLIFY 2S neck air conditioner uses the powerful KU 2.0 Pro chip to instantly lower the temperature by 30°F in just one second. The two cooling plates around your neck provide full coverage for maximum cooling effect, keeping you cool and refreshed no matter how hot it gets. Plus, the advanced NTC chip ensures a constant cooling sensation, lowering your perceived temperature by 30°F even in temperatures up to 90°F. [Cool That Surrounds You] COOLIFY 2S neck fan provides a broader air flow coverage that can reach both the face and neck with its dual-layer design featuring four air ducts, resulting in a 360° cooling effect. COOLIFY personal fans features HyperVortex technology that delivers strong and comfortable air flow, refreshing cool to help you better enjoy outdoor activities. [Keep Cool All Day] The upgraded 5000mAh battery with an 80% better conversion rate allows COOLIFY portabel fan to cool for up to 28 hours in Eco setting, or 4 hours in Max. COOLIFY 2S portable neck fan also comes with an 18W fast charging cable that can charge up to 80% in 1.5 hours, and fully charge in 2.5 hours. Plus, COOLIFY 2S neck fan rechargeable can be used while charging to maximize its usage time. [Personalize at Your Fingertips] COOLIFY 2S personal neck fan places a strong emphasis on the user experience, with Bluetooth app functionality for effortless control of cooling, heating, and air blowing with just a single click. Furthermore, COOLIFY 2S neck cooler boasts a stepless adjustment feature, enabling you to fine-tune the temperature to your exact specifications. [Designed for Comfort] COOLIFY 2S cooling neck fan delivers unmatched comfort and performance with its adjustable silicone that conforms to all neck sizes and stays securely in place even during high-impact activities. At 14OZ and a whisper-quiet 31dB, it's the perfect neck cooling solution for anyone looking for comfort and convenience. The anti-hair-pinch design adds an extra layer of comfort during use, making COOLIFY 2S portable personal fan an essential accessory for any active individual. [TORRAS Care] The package includes TORRAS COOLIFY 2S Wearable Air Conditioner x1, Portable Carry Bag x1, and USB-C Charging Cable x1. Enjoy a 30-day no-questions-asked returns policy, 180-day limited warranty, and lifetime technical support with a 12-hour response time. The COOLIFY 2S personal air conditioner makes for a perfect personalized gift for mom, dad, women, men, family, friends, lovers, or birthdays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rkkgPOpEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TORRAS","source_asin":"B0BXKJNG19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKJNG19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKJNG19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
