window.products.push({"id":546510,"name":"PackIt Freezable Traveler Lunch Bag, Tie Dye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pGZDlEuYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As cute as is it cool, this handy lunch bag offers serious cooling power in a super-compact design. Featuring PackIt's groundbreaking cooling technology, this everyday essential chills food and drinks cool for hours-no separate ice packs needed! The secret is freezable gel built right into the walls of the bag. To use, simply flatten the bag and place the entire bag in the freezer overnight. In the morning, the walls of the Traveler Lunch Bag will be completely frozen and ready to chill food and drinks for hours. Because there are no extra parts, you'll never be hassling with or hunting down missing pieces. This handbag-style cooler has a wide base so you can carry large containers and not worry about spilling in transit. The top-load design lets you quickly access food and drinks on the go while a reinforced zipper seals in cool, dry air. There's an exterior slip pocket that's perfect for storing napkins and utensils. A reinforced handle stands up to heavy containers so you're never slowed down on the go. The Freezable Traveler Lunch Bag is ideal for work, travel or errands. And it's so stylish that you'd never guess it acts like a cooler! This soft sided Freezable Traveler Lunch Bag is made from nontoxic gel and gel liner. Like all PackIt products, the Traveler Bag is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. PackIt's Freezable Traveler Lunch Bag measures 11.5 inches tall, 14 inches wide and 6 inches deep while open. When folded, it measures 11.5 inches tall, 14 inches wide and 2 inches long for easy storage in the freezer. Cleaning is easy: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pGZDlEuYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B0188I082A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0188I082A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0188I082A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
