window.products.push({"id":546641,"name":"Fit & Fresh Cool Coolers, Slim Ice Packs for Lunch Boxes, Bags and Coolers, Sunglasses Shapes for Kids, Set of 4, Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wqQ3ndL1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cool Coolers Multicolored Sunglasses Slim Ice Packs are perfectly sized to fit in all types of lunch bags and boxes. So go ahead and bring all your favorite foods with you on the go, knowing that what you pack will stay cool and fresh! With the Cool Coolers Ice Packs no matter what food you pair with them, it will stay safe and fresh from morning 'til lunch and beyond! Fit & Fresh offers innovative and convenient solutions to make it easier to eat healthier at work, at school and on the go. We make it easier for whole family to eat healthy wherever you go with reusable containers, insulated lunch bags, insulated totes & much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wqQ3ndL1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fit & Fresh","source_asin":"B00LH12EFA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-546641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LH12EFA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LH12EFA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
